{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cWhat is going on?\u201d</strong> is a new style of horror game that combines <i>anomaly detection</i> with <i>survival horror</i>.<br>Use your flashlight and CCTV to protect your home, detect incoming threats, and eliminate them before it\u2019s too late.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Tension</strong>: Your flashlight battery drains quickly but recharges slowly. Use it wisely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 Nights of Survival</strong>: Face increasingly dangerous threats as the atmosphere shifts from day to night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of Enemies</strong>: Special enemies interfere with your cameras or disable your flashlight, testing your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immediate Danger</strong>: Some enemies break into your room\u2014if you don\u2019t hide under the bed in time, it\u2019s game over!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Horror Experience</strong>: Blending the anomaly-spotting gameplay  with the CCTV survival horror.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide &amp; Fight:</strong>\u00a0Fight when they are not close to you, but hide when they are close to your room.\u00a0</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4050430?t=1760625739","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4050430?t=1760625739","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050430/59dddff0f9511371269f27d5c64fdd3de495fe4d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760625739","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050430/59dddff0f9511371269f27d5c64fdd3de495fe4d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760625739","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Time